[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 18.56,
    "text": "Welcome."
  },
  {
    "start": 22.08,
    "end": 24.56,
    "text": "Find a position your body can settle into."
  },
  {
    "start": 30.0,
    "end": 36.88,
    "text": "When you're ready let your eyes close."
  },
  {
    "start": 36.88,
    "end": 46.16,
    "text": "Take a slow breath in through the nose, and a long easy release."
  },
  {
    "start": 46.16,
    "end": 57.92,
    "text": "Again, a full breath in, and a slower exhale."
  },
  {
    "start": 57.92,
    "end": 70.8,
    "text": "One more, drawing the breath all the way in, and letting everything go on the way out."
  },
  {
    "start": 74.8,
    "end": 81.68,
    "text": "Right here, nothing is missing."
  },
  {
    "start": 81.68,
    "end": 85.68,
    "text": "Nothing is owed."
  },
  {
    "start": 85.68,
    "end": 88.56,
    "text": "This moment is already complete."
  },
  {
    "start": 88.56,
    "end": 96.56,
    "text": "Bring your attention to your body."
  },
  {
    "start": 96.56,
    "end": 103.44,
    "text": "The shape of your hands resting."
  },
  {
    "start": 103.44,
    "end": 109.44,
    "text": "The slow rhythm of breath moving in and out."
  },
  {
    "start": 109.44,
    "end": 122.32,
    "text": "And now, in your mind, soften the edges of your body."
  },
  {
    "start": 122.32,
    "end": 127.2,
    "text": "Let yourself feel a little less solid."
  },
  {
    "start": 127.2,
    "end": 131.2,
    "text": "A little more open."
  },
  {
    "start": 131.2,
    "end": 139.2,
    "text": "Like a field of awareness in the shape of you."
  },
  {
    "start": 139.2,
    "end": 142.08,
    "text": "You are not separate from the room."
  },
  {
    "start": 142.08,
    "end": 146.08,
    "text": "Not separate from the air."
  },
  {
    "start": 146.08,
    "end": 152.08,
    "text": "Not separate from the energy moving through everything."
  },
  {
    "start": 152.08,
    "end": 158.96,
    "text": "You are part of a vast living field."
  },
  {
    "start": 158.96,
    "end": 160.96,
    "text": "A field made of possibility."
  },
  {
    "start": 160.96,
    "end": 166.96,
    "text": "A field that responds to the signal you send."
  },
  {
    "start": 166.96,
    "end": 175.84,
    "text": "Imagine your body as a fine instrument."
  },
  {
    "start": 175.84,
    "end": 177.84,
    "text": "A receiver."
  },
  {
    "start": 179.84,
    "end": 183.84,
    "text": "Tuned to whatever frequency you choose."
  },
  {
    "start": 183.84,
    "end": 196.88,
    "text": "When you broadcast worry, the field meets you with more to worry about."
  },
  {
    "start": 196.88,
    "end": 202.32,
    "text": "When you broadcast having, the field meets you with more to receive."
  },
  {
    "start": 205.84,
    "end": 208.8,
    "text": "Today we are practicing the frequency of having."
  },
  {
    "start": 212.16,
    "end": 215.12,
    "text": "Bring to mind something already true in your life."
  },
  {
    "start": 218.64,
    "end": 219.44,
    "text": "Something good."
  },
  {
    "start": 220.72,
    "end": 221.6,
    "text": "Something present."
  },
  {
    "start": 225.04,
    "end": 226.24,
    "text": "A person who loves you."
  },
  {
    "start": 227.52,
    "end": 229.12,
    "text": "A place that feels safe."
  },
  {
    "start": 230.64,
    "end": 233.12,
    "text": "A skill you've built with your own hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 236.48,
    "end": 238.96,
    "text": "Let it arrive without effort."
  },
  {
    "start": 242.32,
    "end": 243.68,
    "text": "Whatever comes first."
  },
  {
    "start": 245.28,
    "end": 246.16,
    "text": "That's the one."
  },
  {
    "start": 249.52,
    "end": 254.24,
    "text": "And as you hold it in your awareness, feel what happens in your chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 257.6,
    "end": 259.36,
    "text": "A warmth, maybe."
  },
  {
    "start": 262.64,
    "end": 263.52,
    "text": "A softness."
  },
  {
    "start": 266.96,
    "end": 268.24,
    "text": "A quiet steadiness."
  },
  {
    "start": 271.68,
    "end": 274.96,
    "text": "This is your body remembering what abundance feels like."
  },
  {
    "start": 278.56,
    "end": 279.84,
    "text": "Not the wanting of it."
  },
  {
    "start": 282.16,
    "end": 283.12,
    "text": "The having of it."
  },
  {
    "start": 286.64,
    "end": 287.92,
    "text": "Let that warmth grow."
  },
  {
    "start": 291.36,
    "end": 295.2,
    "text": "Imagine it as a soft golden light at the center of your chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 298.56,
    "end": 300.88,
    "text": "With each breath, it brightens."
  },
  {
    "start": 304.32,
    "end": 304.8,
    "text": "Steady."
  },
  {
    "start": 306.16,
    "end": 306.72,
    "text": "Generous."
  },
  {
    "start": 308.16,
    "end": 308.88,
    "text": "Unhurried."
  },
  {
    "start": 312.32,
    "end": 313.84,
    "text": "This light is your signal."
  },
  {
    "start": 317.28,
    "end": 320.8,
    "text": "This is the frequency you are broadcasting into the field."
  },
  {
    "start": 324.16,
    "end": 326.48,
    "text": "Now let your awareness drift outward."
  },
  {
    "start": 329.92,
    "end": 331.68,
    "text": "Past the edges of your body."
  },
  {
    "start": 335.12,
    "end": 336.8,
    "text": "Past the walls of the room."
  },
  {
    "start": 340.32,
    "end": 343.04,
    "text": "Into the larger field that holds everything."
  },
  {
    "start": 346.4,
    "end": 352.08,
    "text": "Somewhere in this field, there is a version of you who already lives in abundance."
  },
  {
    "start": 355.44,
    "end": 360.64,
    "text": "The version of you whose work is alive and well-rewarded."
  },
  {
    "start": 364.0,
    "end": 366.96,
    "text": "Whose relationships feel easy and generous."
  },
  {
    "start": 370.32,
    "end": 372.8,
    "text": "Whose body feels strong and at home."
  },
  {
    "start": 376.32,
    "end": 380.4,
    "text": "Whose mind is clear and quietly confident."
  },
  {
    "start": 383.92,
    "end": 385.84,
    "text": "That version is not a fantasy."
  },
  {
    "start": 389.36,
    "end": 393.04,
    "text": "That version is already here in the field."
  },
  {
    "start": 396.4,
    "end": 398.32,
    "text": "A frequency you can tune to."
  },
  {
    "start": 402.0,
    "end": 402.88,
    "text": "Take a breath in."
  },
  {
    "start": 406.32,
    "end": 407.6,
    "text": "And as you breathe out."
  },
  {
    "start": 409.04,
    "end": 411.76,
    "text": "Imagine that version of you stepping toward you."
  },
  {
    "start": 412.8,
    "end": 414.0,
    "text": "Across the field."
  },
  {
    "start": 417.36,
    "end": 417.92,
    "text": "Closer."
  },
  {
    "start": 425.2,
    "end": 427.92,
    "text": "And gently merging into your body."
  },
  {
    "start": 431.44,
    "end": 432.4,
    "text": "Feel the shift."
  },
  {
    "start": 435.76,
    "end": 437.28,
    "text": "Your shoulders settling."
  },
  {
    "start": 440.64,
    "end": 442.0,
    "text": "Your jaw softening."
  },
  {
    "start": 445.36,
    "end": 447.28,
    "text": "Your chest opening a little more."
  },
  {
    "start": 450.8,
    "end": 452.64,
    "text": "A quiet certainty arriving."
  },
  {
    "start": 456.08,
    "end": 456.8,
    "text": "This is you."
  },
  {
    "start": 459.28,
    "end": 460.48,
    "text": "Already abundant."
  },
  {
    "start": 462.96,
    "end": 464.24,
    "text": "Already arrived."
  },
  {
    "start": 467.6,
    "end": 468.4,
    "text": "Stay here."
  },
  {
    "start": 471.84,
    "end": 473.84,
    "text": "Let your body learn this frequency."
  },
  {
    "start": 477.36,
    "end": 479.6,
    "text": "The nervous system is the antenna."
  },
  {
    "start": 480.8,
    "end": 481.52,
    "text": "The nervous system."
  },
  {
    "start": 481.52,
    "end": 483.76,
    "text": "It is tuning."
  },
  {
    "start": 487.76,
    "end": 488.56,
    "text": "Breathing in."
  },
  {
    "start": 489.68,
    "end": 490.4,
    "text": "Receiving."
  },
  {
    "start": 493.76,
    "end": 494.64,
    "text": "Breathing out."
  },
  {
    "start": 496.56,
    "end": 498.64,
    "text": "Resting in what is already enough."
  },
  {
    "start": 502.08,
    "end": 505.12,
    "text": "Let some quiet truths arrive in the body now."
  },
  {
    "start": 508.48,
    "end": 509.44,
    "text": "I am safe to receive."
  },
  {
    "start": 513.52,
    "end": 515.6,
    "text": "I am safe to have."
  },
  {
    "start": 519.04,
    "end": 520.88,
    "text": "I am a match for what I want."
  },
  {
    "start": 524.24,
    "end": 526.8,
    "text": "The field is conspiring in my favor."
  },
  {
    "start": 530.24,
    "end": 531.92,
    "text": "Notice how those words land."
  },
  {
    "start": 535.76,
    "end": 536.8,
    "text": "As a recognition."
  },
  {
    "start": 540.32,
    "end": 544.64,
    "text": "The version of you that has it, has been here the whole time."
  },
  {
    "start": 548.0,
    "end": 551.84,
    "text": "You are not becoming."
  },
  {
    "start": 551.84,
    "end": 552.56,
    "text": "You are remembering."
  },
  {
    "start": 555.76,
    "end": 559.52,
    "text": "Now imagine the golden light in your chest expanding outward."
  },
  {
    "start": 562.96,
    "end": 564.24,
    "text": "Filling your whole body."
  },
  {
    "start": 565.76,
    "end": 566.56,
    "text": "Your hands."
  },
  {
    "start": 567.84,
    "end": 568.56,
    "text": "Your face."
  },
  {
    "start": 568.56,
    "end": 571.2,
    "text": "The soles of your feet."
  },
  {
    "start": 574.56,
    "end": 576.0,
    "text": "And spilling beyond you."
  },
  {
    "start": 579.36,
    "end": 580.16,
    "text": "Into the room."
  },
  {
    "start": 581.52,
    "end": 582.4,
    "text": "Into your day."
  },
  {
    "start": 582.4,
    "end": 585.84,
    "text": "Into the path in front of you."
  },
  {
    "start": 589.2,
    "end": 592.0,
    "text": "You are walking into a day that knows you."
  },
  {
    "start": 595.44,
    "end": 598.48,
    "text": "A day that has been arranging itself in your favor."
  },
  {
    "start": 601.92,
    "end": 604.8,
    "text": "A day that meets your frequency with its own."
  },
  {
    "start": 608.32,
    "end": 609.2,
    "text": "Slowly now."
  },
  {
    "start": 610.64,
    "end": 611.68,
    "text": "Begin to come back."
  },
  {
    "start": 615.12,
    "end": 616.32,
    "text": "Feel your body again."
  },
  {
    "start": 619.76,
    "end": 621.04,
    "text": "The weight of you."
  },
  {
    "start": 622.64,
    "end": 624.24,
    "text": "The air on your skin."
  },
  {
    "start": 625.76,
    "end": 628.88,
    "text": "The breath moving in and out."
  },
  {
    "start": 634.88,
    "end": 636.56,
    "text": "Take one full breath in."
  },
  {
    "start": 640.0,
    "end": 641.28,
    "text": "And a slow release."
  },
  {
    "start": 644.72,
    "end": 645.52,
    "text": "When you are ready."
  },
  {
    "start": 646.88,
    "end": 648.0,
    "text": "At your own pace."
  },
  {
    "start": 648.72,
    "end": 649.92,
    "text": "Let your eyes open."
  },
  {
    "start": 653.36,
    "end": 654.4,
    "text": "Carry this with you."
  },
  {
    "start": 657.76,
    "end": 659.28,
    "text": "The frequency is set."
  },
  {
    "start": 661.6,
    "end": 663.2,
    "text": "The field is responding."
  },
  {
    "start": 665.52,
    "end": 669.2,
    "text": "Go meet the abundance that is already on its way to you."
  }
]
